>   vowels:       "aeiouy",
>   consonants:   "bcdfgjklmnprstvxz",
>   punctuations: ".,' " // (=93'=94 should be a consonant and not a punctu=
ation, but, he!=85)=20
> };

What matters for =93counting=94 the symbol is only the =93letters=94 field.=
 And adding stress (uppercase characters).

